  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/N1s2APm.png\" alt=\"Banner\" width=\"1903\" height=\"507\" /></p><center>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><h1 style=\"font-size: 24px;\">为你的 Minecraft 体验增添更多乐器！</h1></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">受够了只能靠山羊角来抒发音乐情怀？又或者你已经玩腻了原神里的乐器？</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">那就来看看 Even More Instruments 模组吧！</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ff0000; --darkreader-inline-color: #ff1a1a;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\"><strong>！此模组需要 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/genshin-instruments/\">Genshin Instruments</a> v4.0 或更高版本！</strong></span></p></center>\n<!--<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Join the Development Livestream!</strong></h1>\n<p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YOqkeE_30Ik?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p><hr/>-->\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tDIAfkaUNag\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rnMmBKchqfI\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<br/>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1CVVqa2BHVE\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<br/>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NhZKh6O5eGQ\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<hr /><center>\n<p><h3><strong>你是内容创作者吗？乐器演奏者？</strong></h3></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">通过 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/private-messages/send?recipient=stavwasplays\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CurseForge 私聊</a> 联系我，让你的视频在此展示！</span></p>\n</center><hr /><br/>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>⚠️ 重要 ⚠️：模组作者已退休，该项目停止维护</strong></h2>\n<p>观看下方视频了解更多：</p>\n<p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TUzdklT4vcs?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>  \n<h3>本模组为游戏添加了以下乐器：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>长号</li>\n<li>小提琴（长音与短音 - 使用右Alt键切换！）</li>\n<li>键盘（附带琴架！）</li>\n<li>吉他</li>\n<li>萨克斯</li>\n<li>多种亚洲/日本乐器：\n<ul>\n<li>筝（Koto）</li>\n<li>三味线 &amp; 拨片（Bachi）</li>\n<li>琵琶（普通 &amp; 轮指）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>全部 16 种音符盒均可作为可演奏乐器！</li>\n</ul>\n<br/>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bCLnB21RSj4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>循环器（Looper）</h2>\n<p>使用循环器为你的音乐添加循环！叠加背景音轨、丰富演奏效果，无需第二个朋友帮你记住你的曲目！</p>\n<h2>唱片（Records）</h2>\n<p>录制曲目，并与朋友们分享！使用<strong> <em>/emirecord</em></strong> 命令导出 &amp; 烧录唱片，尽情享受合作的乐趣 ✨</p>\n<p>导出的唱片位于你世界的&nbsp;<em>generated</em> 目录下。</p>\n<h2>完整 MIDI 支持！</h2>\n<p>作为 Genshin Instruments 模组的一部分，所有乐器均拥有原生 MIDI 支持——与其父模组中的对应乐器一样！</p>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WaCIP4lWEzk\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MhHqXmaiCZA\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7PKk7qorFTk\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>预置唱片（Pre-Burned Records）</h2>\n<p>在你的 Minecraft 世界中四处散落着随机唱片——它们似乎是由某个未知存在留下的…… 0-0</p>\n<h3>所有唱片及其位置：</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Super Idol - De Xian Rong</strong>：丛林神庙</li>\n<li><strong>Sad Romance - Ji Pyeongkeyon</strong>：草原村庄</li>\n<li><strong>Timmy Trumpet &amp; Savage - Freaks</strong>：堡垒遗迹</li>\n<li><strong>有趣的唱片（Interesting Record）</strong>：废弃矿井</li>\n<li><strong>H&auml;nschen klein - Franz Wiedemann</strong>：埋藏的宝藏</li>\n</ol>\n\n<br/>\n<details>\n<summary>“有趣的唱片”？它是怎么回事？</summary>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ?si=ltxfCMLOt79VN4BM\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</details>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>多人游戏支持！</h2>\n<p>本模组完全兼容服务器，并针对服务器环境进行了优化。</p>\n<p>*因此，循环器的音数上限为 255 个——可通过 evenmoreinstruments_looperMaxNotes 游戏规则进行修改</p>",
